/// Full behavioral sandbox for the gh-1172 direct-push path of
/// scripts/auto_release.sh: a bare origin whose main carries pubspec 0.1.495
/// tagged v0.1.495 [tagAgeHours] ago (3h = past the 2h coalesce window) plus
