New tests (RED first): 
- `builtinSkillMdByteViolations` flags empty bytes, whitespace-only utf8 bytes, under-floor bytes; passes full bytes.
- source-checker integration still covered.

This is clean, unifies the duplicated message strings, and directly addresses the single-read finding. 

